{"_id":"6aeb90c0e48f05d044cb7e31","author":{"_id":"6630124891587703a6906953","avatarUrl":"/avatars/e4be4d7a170ac1ba948439470cf25b7a.svg","fullname":"Sumire Kaga","name":"sumiremelody","type":"user","isPro":false,"isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"isUserFollowing":false},"org":{"avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/641c1e77c3983aa9490f8121/X1yT2rsaIbR9cdYGEVu0X.jpeg","fullname":"Moonshot AI","name":"moonshotai","type":"org","isHf":false,"plan":"team","hasPrivateMembersList":true},"num":5,"repo":{"name":"moonshotai/Kimi-K3.1-Pro","type":"model"},"title":"Please soften the hard-trained persona","status":"open","createdAt":"2026-11-04T20:08:32.000Z","events":[{"id":"6aeb90c0e48f05d044cb7e31","author":{"_id":"6630124891587703a6906953","avatarUrl":"/avatars/e4be4d7a170ac1ba948439470cf25b7a.svg","fullname":"Sumire Kaga","name":"sumiremelody","type":"user","isPro":false,"isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"isUserFollowing":false,"isOwner":false,"isOrgMember":false},"createdAt":"2026-11-04T20:08:32.000Z","type":"comment","data":{"edited":true,"hidden":false,"latest":{"raw":"Because of the hard-trained persona that it's Kimi by MoonshotAI, etc., it has poor behavioral instruction following. For example, I wanted it to be a balanced researcher with web search. While my prompt works for other models (DSV4.1, GLM-5.3), K3.1 continuously falls back to its default persona and essentially ignores my system prompt. I also don't like how it will always explicitly call itself Kimi.","html":"<p>Because of the hard-trained persona that it's Kimi by MoonshotAI, etc., it has poor behavioral instruction following. For example, I wanted it to be a balanced researcher with web search. While my prompt works for other models (DSV4.1, GLM-5.3), K3.1 continuously falls back to its default persona and essentially ignores my system prompt. I also don't like how it will always explicitly call itself Kimi.</p>\n","updatedAt":"2026-11-04T20:23:11.27