"inline-block\"><span class=\"contents\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/sumiremelody\">@<span class=\"underline\">sumiremelody</span></a></span> </span></span> :</p>\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It’s easy for <span class=\"SVELTE_PARTIAL_HYDRATER contents\" data-target=\"UserMention\" data-props=\"{&quot;user&quot;:&quot;sumiremelody&quot;}\"><span class=\"inline-block\"><span class=\"contents\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/sumiremelody\">@<span class=\"underline\">sumiremelody</span></a></span> </span></span> to say that. Well then, show me you can actually do it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/p-e-w/heretic\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/p-e-w/heretic</a> already demonstrates this for models.<br>... It seems like something that could be trivially abliterated.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>AFAICT, there are exactly zero Kimi models that have been abliterated with heretic. It certainly isn't \"trivial\", especially for a 2T+ model...</p>\n","updatedAt":"2026-11-05T17:33:55.024Z","author":{"_id":"64a8f82532c9473feda84b3c","avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/noauth/LWv44YbFamaYkr3KWtqcx.png","fullname":"Jeff Moe","name":"jebbam","type":"user","isPro":true,"isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"followerCount":2,"isUserFollowing":false,"primaryOrg":{"avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/64a8f82532c9473feda84b3c/t6MYGiAW9CCJbOv7kaGLP.png","fullname":"DeepCrayon","name":"deepcrayon","type":"org","isHf":false,"plan":"team"}}},"numEdits":1,"identifiedLanguage":{"language":"en","probability":0.9731376767158508},"editors":["jebbam"],"editorAvatarUrls":["https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/noauth/LWv44YbFamaYkr3KWtqcx.png"],"reactions":[],"isReport":false}},{"id":"6aecc4670770bfd208b28836","author":{"_id":"6630124891587703a6906953","avatarUrl":"/avatars/e4be4d7a170ac1ba948439470cf25b7a.svg","fullname":"Sumire Kaga","name":"sumiremelody","type":"user","isPro":false,"isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"isUserFollowing":false,"isOwner":false,"isOrgMember":false},"createdAt":"2026-11-05T18:01:11.000Z","type":"comment","data":{"edited":false,"hidden":false,"latest":{"raw":"> @sumiremelody :\n> > > It’s easy for @sumiremelody to say that. Well then, show me you can actually do it.\n> > \n> > https://github.com/p-e-w/heretic already demonstrates this for models.\n> > ... It seems like something that could be trivially abliterated.\n> \n> AFAICT, there are exactly zero Kimi models that have been abliterated with heretic. It certainly isn't \"trivial\", especially for a 2T+ model...\n\nTo be clear, I originally said,\n\n> I don’t *think* so. It **seems** like something that could be trivially abliterated.\n\nAnd the model was released a day ago. It would take time for people to abliterate for something like censorship (which is the common target), if there is any interest at all given the hardware requirements exceeding consumer and most enthusiast hardware.\n\nIt **could** be trivial in the sense that a hypothetical team may only need a judge to determine whether it’s adhering to a non-existent Kimi identity to thus eliminate it. Again, in this context, the abliteration in question was not about censorship but about the “I am Kimi” persona.","html":"<blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"SVELTE_PARTIAL_HYDRATER contents\" data-target=\"UserMention\" data-props=\"{&quot;user&quot;:&quot;sumiremelody&quot;}\"><span class=\"inline-block\"><span class=\"contents\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/sumiremelody\">@<span class=\"underline\">sumiremelody</span></a></span> </span></span> :</p>\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It’s easy for <span class=\"SVELTE_PARTIAL_HYDRATER contents\" data-target=\"UserMention\" data-props=\"{&quot;user&quot;:&quot;sumiremelody&quot;}\"><span class=\"inline-block\"><span class=\"contents\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/sumiremelody\">@<span class=\"underline\">sumiremelody</span></a></span> </span></span> to say that. Well then, show me you can actually do it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/p-e-w/heretic\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/p-e-w/heretic</a> already demonstrates this for models.<br>... It seems like something that could be trivially abliterated.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>AFAICT, there are exactly zero Kimi models that have been abliterated with heretic. It certainly isn't \"trivial\", especially for a 2T+ model...</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>To be clear, I originally said,</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I don’t <em>think</em> so. It <strong>seems</strong> like something that could be trivially abliterated.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>And the model was released a day ago. It would take time for people to abliterate for something like censorship (which is the common target), if there is any interest at all given the hardware requirements exceeding consumer and most enthusiast hardware.</p>\n<p>It <strong>could</strong> be trivial in the sense that a hypothetical team may only need a judge to determine whether it’s adhering to a non-existent Kimi identity to thus eliminate it. Again, in this context, the abliteration in question was not about censorship but about the “I am Kimi” persona.</p>\n","updatedAt":"2026-11-05T18:01:11.075Z","author":{"_id":"6630124891587703a6906953","avatarUrl":"/avatars/e4be4d7a170ac1ba948439470cf25b7a.svg","fullname":"Sumire Kaga","name":"sumiremelody","type":"user","isPro":false,"isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"isUserFollowing":false}},"numEdits":0,"identifiedLanguage":{"language":"en","probability":0.9556166529655457},"editors":["sumiremelody"],"editorAvatarUrls":["/avatars/e4be4d7a170ac1ba948439470cf25b7a.svg"],"reactions":[{"reaction":"👍","users":["zelk12"],"count":1}],"isReport":false}},{"id":"6aecc6b83c4b04be518db1fb","author":{"_id":"67cf342cf634a7b794d384d0","avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/no-auth/gC9fDCvzAzJIluf6KkLCH.png","fullname":"Suzuki kota","name"